Package: TaxonBodyMassML
Title: Predict Species Body Mass Using the TaxonBodyMassML XGBoost Model
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Grant", "Pasquantonio", role = "aut"),
    person("Anish Chowdary", "Pendurti", role = "aut"),
    person("Hailey", "Prater", role = "aut"),
    person("Mark", "Novak", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mark.novak@oregonstate.edu"))
Description: Predicts body mass for species from taxonomic identity using an
    XGBoost machine learning model trained on published and unpublished body
    mass data spanning the tree of life. Taxonomy is resolved automatically
    via the GBIF fuzzy-match API with an NCBI Entrez fallback. Model artifacts
    (~2 GB) are downloaded from Hugging Face Hub on first use and cached
    locally. Internet access is required on first use for artifact download and
    for taxonomy lookups.
